                    "pins": {
                        "_comment": [
                            "Wiring between the Glasgow Interface Explorer C3 pads and",
                            "the IobeamTech analog board. When this section is missing",
                            "or empty, no Resource constraints are emitted - the FPGA",
                            "still synthesises and FakeAdcSimulator drives the data path",
